 "notes": "The outline (02_outline.md) is incomplete. It has headings only for p.36–45 and from p.61 on. The p.1–30 range failed because pdftoppm isn't installed, and p.46–60 is missing from the file. Parts of the outline were also built from Docling's own output rather than from the PDF, so it isn't a fully independent answer key. In this batch, p.36–45 follow the outline exactly. For p.46–56 I applied the level pattern the outline uses for 基本目標３〜５ (p.61 on): 基本目標=2, 【重点戦略】/【分野別計画】=3, Ⅰ〜Ⅳ/（ｎ）=4, A）/指標/現状と課題/施策の展開=5, ①=6. Under the instruction \"section_header not in the Markdown becomes text\", these headings would all have turned into text, so I treated them as headings because the outline is missing for those pages. In the same section, I changed 「Ⅰ 将来を担う子育て支援戦略」(1897) and 「Ⅰ 地域と連携した学力向上戦略」(2060) from list_item to section_header. Per the outline, I merged 1853 and 1854 into one 第２部 heading at level 1; the result has no space between 第２部 and the rest of the title. 1857 (the same text repeated on p.44) and the text inside the p.44 diagram (1864, 1866, 1871, 1872, 1874, 1877, 1883, 1886) are now text. I left the SDG icon text on p.41 (1811, 1824–1827) unchanged. I found no dotted leaders or page numbers to remove."
